  "content": {
    "id": "p23-q54-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "54",
    "prompt": "Given acute angles $\\alpha$ and $\\beta$, find the exact value of $\\alpha-\\beta$ if $\\tan\\alpha=3$ and $\\tan\\beta=\\frac12$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\alpha-\\beta=\\frac\\pi4$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\tan(\\alpha-\\beta)&=\\frac{\\tan\\alpha-\\tan\\beta}{1+\\tan\\alpha\\tan\\beta}\\\\&=\\frac{3-\\frac12}{1+3\\times\\frac12}\\\\&=1.\\end{align*}$$\n\nSince both angles are acute, $-\\frac\\pi2<\\alpha-\\beta<\\frac\\pi2$. Hence $\\alpha-\\beta=\\frac\\pi4$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 50
  },
